          1*       <136> ECHO                                                      OP1[  IS_CONST (268435443) '%3Cdiv+class%3D%22body_padded%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ch1%3EHelp+-+Brute+Force+%28Login%29%3C%2Fh1%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3Cdiv+id%3D%22code%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctable+width%3D%27100%25%27+bgcolor%3D%27white%27+style%3D%22border%3A2px+%23C0C0C0+solid%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctr%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctd%3E%3Cdiv+id%3D%22code%22%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EAbout%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EPassword+cracking+is+the+process+of+recovering+passwords+from+data+that+has+been+stored+in+or+transmitted+by+a+computer+system.%0D%0A%09%09%09A+common+approach+is+to+repeatedly+try+guesses+for+the+password.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EUsers+often+choose+weak+passwords.+Examples+of+insecure+choices+include+single+words+found+in+dictionaries%2C+family+names%2C+any+too+short+password%0D%0A%09%09%09%28usually+thought+to+be+less+than+6+or+7+characters%29%2C+or+predictable+patterns%0D%0A%09%09%09%28e.g.+alternating+vowels+and+consonants%2C+which+is+known+as+leetspeak%2C+so+%22password%22+becomes+%22p%4055w0rd%22%29.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3ECreating+a+targeted+wordlists%2C+which+is+generated+towards+the+target%2C+often+gives+the+highest+success+rate.+There+are+public+tools+out+there+that+will+create+a+dictionary%0D%0A%09%09%09based+on+a+combination+of+company+websites%2C+personal+social+networks+and+other+common+information+%28such+as+birthdays+or+year+of+graduation%29.%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EA+last+resort+is+to+try+every+possible+password%2C+known+as+a+brute+force+attack.+In+theory%2C+if+there+is+no+limit+to+the+number+of+attempts%2C+a+brute+force+attack+will+always%0D%0A%09%09%09be+successful+since+the+rules+for+acceptable+passwords+must+be+publicly+known%3B+but+as+the+length+of+the+password+increases%2C+so+does+the+number+of+possible+passwords%0D%0A%09%09%09making+the+attack+time+longer.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EObjective%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EYour+goal+is+to+get+the+administrator%E2%80%99s+password+by+brute+forcing.+Bonus+points+for+getting+the+other+four+user+passwords%21%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3ELow+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+developer+has+completely+missed+out+%3Cu%3Eany+protections+methods%3C%2Fu%3E%2C+allowing+for+anyone+to+try+as+many+times+as+they+wish%2C+to+login+to+any+user+without+any+repercussions.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EMedium+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThis+stage+adds+a+sleep+on+the+failed+login+screen.+This+mean+when+you+login+incorrectly%2C+there+will+be+an+extra+two+second+wait+before+the+page+is+visible.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThis+will+only+slow+down+the+amount+of+requests+which+can+be+processed+a+minute%2C+making+it+longer+to+brute+force.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EHigh+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThere+has+been+an+%22anti+Cross-Site+Request+Forgery+%28CSRF%29+token%22+used.+There+is+a+old+myth+that+this+protection+will+stop+brute+force+attacks.+This+is+not+the+case.%0D%0A%09%09%09This+level+also+extends+on+the+medium+level%2C+by+waiting+when+there+is+a+failed+login+but+this+time+it+is+a+random+amount+of+time+between+two+and+four+seconds.%0D%0A%09%09%09The+idea+of+this+is+to+try+and+confuse+any+timing+predictions.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EUsing+a+' ]
