          9*       <136> ECHO                                                      OP1[  IS_CONST (268435432) '+form+could+have+a+similar+effect+as+a+CSRF+token.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EImpossible+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EBrute+force+%28and+user+enumeration%29+should+not+be+possible+in+the+impossible+level.+The+developer+has+added+a+%22lock+out%22+feature%2C+where+if+there+are+five+bad+logins+within%0D%0A%09%09%09the+last+15+minutes%2C+the+locked+out+user+cannot+log+in.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EIf+the+locked+out+user+tries+to+login%2C+even+with+a+valid+password%2C+it+will+say+their+username+or+password+is+incorrect.+This+will+make+it+impossible+to+know%0D%0A%09%09%09if+there+is+a+valid+account+on+the+system%2C+with+that+password%2C+and+if+the+account+is+locked.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThis+can+cause+a+%22Denial+of+Service%22+%28DoS%29%2C+by+having+someone+continually+trying+to+login+to+someone%27s+account.%0D%0A%09%09%09This+level+would+need+to+be+extended+by+blacklisting+the+attacker+%28e.g.+IP+address%2C+country%2C+user-agent%29.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%0D%0A%09%3C%2Ftr%3E%0D%0A%09%3C%2Ftable%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3Cp%3EReference%3A+' ]
